# Files that run inside Linux containers or POSIX shells keep LF line endings, even in a
# Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true. A CRLF shell script fails inside the container
# ("set: Illegal option -"), and PostgreSQL then skips its role set-up without stopping.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
*.inc text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
